[00:25.15]1. Praise Jehovah’s Firstborn,
[00:29.55]God’s duly appointed King.
[00:34.27]He reigns for truth and justice;
[00:39.15]Rich blessings his rule will bring.
[00:41.59]With dignity and splendor
[00:44.03]And love for God’s great name,
[00:53.26]He’ll vindicate Jehovah,
[00:58.26]His sov’reignty proclaim.
[01:00.76](Chorus)
[01:03.26]Praise Jehovah’s Firstborn!
[01:08.64]All praise God’s anointed Son.
[01:13.53]Installed upon Mount Zion,
[01:18.09]His Kingship has now begun!
[01:22.53]2. Praise Jehovah’s Firstborn,
[01:26.97]Who died so that we may live.
[01:36.97]He humbly paid the ransom;
[01:39.47]Our sins God can now forgive.
[01:41.97]The bride of Christ awaits him,
[01:44.47]Adorned for him in white.
[01:47.80]This marriage in the heavens
[01:51.00]Will prove God’s rule is right.
[01:54.20](Chorus)
[01:57.40]Praise Jehovah’s Firstborn!
[02:00.23]All praise God’s anointed Son.
[02:03.06]Installed upon Mount Zion,
[02:24.48]His Kingship has now begun!